  "(a) Imperfections are evaluated by one or more of the examination methods given, as specified in paras. K341.4.1 and K341.4.2.",
  "(b) “N/A” indicates this Chapter does not establish acceptance criteria or does not require evaluation of this kind of imperfection for this type of weld.",
