  "(d) Ellipsis (…) indicates examination method not generally used for evaluating this kind of imperfection.",
  "(e) Symbols A through F are explained in the table on the next page.",
  "(1) Criteria given are for required examination. More-stringent criteria may be specified in the engineering design.",
  "(2) Longitudinal welds include only those permitted in paras. K302.3.4 and K305. The criteria shall be met by all welds, including those made in accordance with a standard listed in Table K326.1.1-1 or in Appendix K.",
  "(3) Fillet welds include only those permitted in para. K311.2.2.",
  "(4) Branch connection welds include only those permitted in para. K328.5.4."
